<title>USA: Real Goods files for 1.3 mln shr offer.</title>
<headline>Real Goods files for 1.3 mln shr offer.</headline>
<dateline>UKIAH, Calif. 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Real Goods Trading Corp Thursday said it has registered with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission to sell 1.3 million common shares in a public offering.</p>
<p>In a statement, Real Goods said of the total, 1.0 million shares will be sold by the company and 300,000 shares by a selling shareholder.</p>
<p>Proceeds will be used primarily to open additional retail stores and for general corporate purposes. The company said it intends to sell stock via the Internet, and it hopes to begin the offering by mid-August.</p>
</text>
